/* EdgeOS */
"%@ is not a VLAN-aware switch0 port. On EdgeOS, VLANs work only on switch0 ports with vlan-aware enabled." = "%@ 不是支持 VLAN 的 switch0 端口。在 EdgeOS 上,VLAN 只能用于已启用 vlan-aware 的 switch0 端口。";
"Another change on the router is already waiting for confirmation. Confirm it or let its timer run out first." = "路由器上已有另一项更改在等待确认。请先确认它,或等待其计时器结束。";
"EdgeOS can't change a VLAN's number. Delete the VLAN and add it again with the new number." = "EdgeOS 无法更改 VLAN 的编号。请删除该 VLAN,并用新编号重新添加。";
"Netdeck could not check whether the running configuration is saved. Changes that were never saved are lost if the router restarts with its saved configuration." = "Netdeck 无法检查运行中的配置是否已保存。如果路由器以其已保存的配置重新启动,从未保存的更改会丢失。";
"Netdeck stopped the confirm timer and loaded the saved configuration again." = "Netdeck 已停止确认计时器,并重新加载了已保存的配置。";
"On EdgeOS a VLAN has only a name (the description of its switch0 vif). Rename the VLAN instead." = "在 EdgeOS 上,VLAN 只有名称(其 switch0 vif 的描述)。请改为重命名 VLAN。";
"The confirm timer is still running: the router restarts with its saved configuration when it runs out." = "确认计时器仍在运行:计时结束时,路由器将以其已保存的配置重新启动。";
"The router keeps no commit revisions, so EdgeOS can't arm its confirm timer. Turn on commit revisions (system config-management commit-revisions) first." = "路由器不保留提交版本,因此 EdgeOS 无法启动其确认计时器。请先开启提交版本(system config-management commit-revisions)。";
"The router rejected some commands:" = "路由器拒绝了部分命令:";
"The running configuration has changes that were never saved. If you don't confirm in time, the router restarts with its saved configuration and those changes are lost as well." = "运行中的配置有从未保存的更改。如果你没有及时确认,路由器将以其已保存的配置重新启动,这些更改也会丢失。";
"This EdgeOS version has no commit-confirm, so Netdeck can't apply changes with a safety timer." = "此 EdgeOS 版本没有 commit-confirm,因此 Netdeck 无法使用安全计时器应用更改。";
"VLAN 1 is the default VLAN; EdgeOS keeps the name 'default' for it." = "VLAN 1 是默认 VLAN;EdgeOS 为它保留名称“default”。";
"VLANs on EdgeOS need the switch0 interface with vlan-aware enabled. Set that up on the router first." = "EdgeOS 上的 VLAN 需要启用 vlan-aware 的 switch0 接口。请先在路由器上设置。";

/* Cisco IOS */
"This switch's IOS can't undo changes on its own (no revert timer). Netdeck doesn't apply changes without it." = "此交换机的 IOS 无法自行撤销更改(没有 revert timer)。没有它,Netdeck 不会应用更改。";
"Netdeck needs privileged mode on this switch. Log in with a privilege 15 user or give the enable password." = "Netdeck 需要此交换机的特权模式。请使用权限级别为 15 的用户登录,或提供 enable 密码。";
"Netdeck couldn't set up the configuration archive the revert timer needs:" = "Netdeck 无法设置 revert timer 所需的配置归档:";
"IOS has no candidate configuration to check in advance. The switch checks each command as it is applied; if one is rejected, or if you don't confirm in time, the revert timer puts the previous configuration back." = "IOS 没有可提前检查的候选配置。交换机在应用每条命令时进行检查;如果某条被拒绝,或你没有及时确认,revert timer 会恢复之前的配置。";
"The configuration archive the revert timer needs is not set up yet. Netdeck turns it on first (archive path flash:netdeck), outside the timer; this doesn't affect traffic." = "revert timer 所需的配置归档尚未设置。Netdeck 会先将其开启(archive path flash:netdeck),此步骤在计时器之外进行,不会影响流量。";
"The switch shut this port down after an error (err-disabled)." = "交换机因错误关闭了此端口(err-disabled)。";
"%@: IOS doesn't accept '?' in a description." = "%@:IOS 的描述中不接受“?”。";
"%@ is a routed port (no switchport). Netdeck doesn't change VLANs on routed ports." = "%@ 是路由端口(no switchport)。Netdeck 不会更改路由端口上的 VLAN。";
"%@ belongs to Port-channel%@; its VLANs follow the port-channel. Netdeck doesn't change them." = "%@ 属于 Port-channel%@;其 VLAN 跟随该 port-channel。Netdeck 不会更改它们。";
"VLANs 1002–1005 are reserved on Cisco switches." = "Cisco 交换机保留了 1002–1005 号 VLAN。";
"'%@': IOS VLAN names can't contain spaces or '?' and are at most 32 characters." = "“%@”:IOS 的 VLAN 名称不能包含空格或“?”,且最多 32 个字符。";
"IOS VLANs have no description. Leave it empty." = "IOS 的 VLAN 没有描述。请留空。";
"IOS can't change a VLAN's number. Add a VLAN with the new number and move the ports to it." = "IOS 无法更改 VLAN 的编号。请添加一个使用新编号的 VLAN,并将端口移到其中。";
"The default VLAN (1) can't be renamed or deleted." = "默认 VLAN(1)无法重命名或删除。";

