/* MikroTik RouterOS */
"%@: VLANs on RouterOS need bridge VLAN filtering. Add the port to the bridge and turn on vlan-filtering first." = "%@:RouterOS 上的 VLAN 需要 bridge VLAN 过滤。请先将该端口加入 bridge,并开启 vlan-filtering。";
"VLANs on RouterOS need bridge VLAN filtering. Turn on vlan-filtering on the bridge first." = "RouterOS 上的 VLAN 需要 bridge VLAN 过滤。请先在 bridge 上开启 vlan-filtering。";
"VLANs %@ share one bridge VLAN entry on the router. Split it into one entry per VLAN first." = "VLAN %@ 在路由器上共用一个 bridge VLAN 条目。请先将其拆分为每个 VLAN 一个条目。";
"%@: choose a VLAN for this port." = "%@:请为此端口选择一个 VLAN。";
"RouterOS bridge VLANs have no names of their own. Netdeck shows the name of the VLAN's interface, or vlan and its number." = "RouterOS 的 bridge VLAN 没有自己的名称。Netdeck 显示 VLAN 接口的名称,没有接口时显示 vlan 加其编号。";
"VLAN '%@' has the VLAN interface '%@' on the router. Remove that interface first." = "VLAN“%@”在路由器上有 VLAN 接口“%@”。请先移除该接口。";
"The router asks for a new password. Log in once with WinBox, WebFig or a terminal, set a password, then connect again." = "路由器要求设置新密码。请用 WinBox、WebFig 或终端登录一次并设置密码,然后重新连接。";
"RouterOS has no candidate configuration to check in advance. Netdeck sends the commands one by one and undoes all of them if the router rejects one." = "RouterOS 没有可提前检查的候选配置。Netdeck 会逐条发送命令,如果路由器拒绝其中一条,则会撤销全部命令。";
"The router did not confirm the command." = "路由器未确认该命令。";
"The undo timer is still on the router. Confirm again." = "撤销计时器仍在路由器上。请再次确认。";
"This change is too large for the router's undo script. Apply it in smaller parts." = "此更改对路由器的撤销脚本来说太大。请分成较小的部分应用。";
"Netdeck could not read the router's clock, so it can't set the undo timer. Nothing was changed." = "Netdeck 无法读取路由器的时钟,因此无法设置撤销计时器。没有任何更改。";
"The undo script on the router is incomplete." = "路由器上的撤销脚本不完整。";
"The undo timer did not start on the router." = "撤销计时器未在路由器上启动。";
"Netdeck could not set the undo timer on the router, so nothing was changed." = "Netdeck 无法在路由器上设置撤销计时器,因此没有任何更改。";
"The undo script did not finish on the router." = "路由器上的撤销脚本未执行完成。";
"Undo runs at %@ (router time)" = "撤销将在 %@(路由器时间)运行";
"Another session applied these changes and they still wait for confirmation. Discarding runs their undo script now, so the router goes back to the settings from before them. This can't be undone." = "另一个会话应用了这些更改,它们仍在等待确认。丢弃会立即运行其撤销脚本,路由器将恢复到这些更改之前的设置。此操作无法撤销。";

/* Server power commands (Redfish) */
"Sending the power command" = "正在发送电源命令";
"Power" = "电源";
"Turn on" = "开机";
"Shut down" = "关机";
"Restart" = "重新启动";
"Force restart" = "强制重新启动";
"Force off" = "强制关机";
"Power cycle" = "断电重启";
"Turn on %@?" = "要开启 %@ 吗?";
"Shut down %@?" = "要关闭 %@ 吗?";
"Restart %@?" = "要重新启动 %@ 吗?";
"Force restart %@?" = "要强制重新启动 %@ 吗?";
"Force off %@?" = "要强制关闭 %@ 吗?";
"Power cycle %@?" = "要对 %@ 断电重启吗?";
"The server powers on and starts its operating system." = "服务器将开机并启动其操作系统。";
"The operating system is asked to shut down. Everything running on the server stops." = "将请求操作系统关机。服务器上运行的所有内容都会停止。";
"The operating system is asked to restart. Everything running on the server stops until it is back." = "将请求操作系统重新启动。在服务器恢复之前,其上运行的所有内容都会停止。";
"The server restarts at once, without shutting down the operating system. Unsaved data is lost." = "服务器会立即重新启动,不会先关闭操作系统。未保存的数据会丢失。";
"The server turns off at once, like pulling the power cord. Unsaved data is lost." = "服务器会立即关闭,就像拔掉电源线一样。未保存的数据会丢失。";
"The server turns off at once and back on, like pulling the power cord and plugging it in again. Unsaved data is lost." = "服务器会立即关闭再重新开启,就像拔掉电源线再插回去一样。未保存的数据会丢失。";
"The server accepted the power command. Its power state can take a minute to change; read again to see it." = "服务器已接受电源命令。电源状态可能需要一分钟才会改变;请重新读取以查看。";
"Netdeck reads this device over its API and never changes its settings. Power commands go out only after you confirm them." = "Netdeck 通过 API 读取此设备,绝不会更改其设置。只有在你确认后,才会发送电源命令。";

/* Embedded SSH client, sandbox */
"Trust the new host key" = "信任新的主机密钥";
"Use the system ssh command (outside the Mac App Store)" = "使用系统 ssh 命令(Mac App Store 之外)";
"Netdeck has its own SSH client. Turn this on for devices it can't talk to, such as older ones that only offer RSA host keys or older ciphers. Applies to the next connection." = "Netdeck 自带 SSH 客户端。对于它无法通信的设备(例如只提供 RSA 主机密钥或旧版加密算法的老设备),请开启此项。将在下次连接时生效。";
"The SSH connection was closed by the device." = "设备关闭了 SSH 连接。";
"Connection timed out during the SSH handshake with %@." = "与 %@ 进行 SSH 握手时连接超时。";
"The device refused the SSH shell: %@" = "设备拒绝了 SSH shell:%@";
"The device refused to start an SSH shell." = "设备拒绝启动 SSH shell。";
"The device's SSH algorithms aren't supported by the built-in SSH client: %@" = "内置 SSH 客户端不支持该设备的 SSH 算法:%@";
"SSH algorithms: %@" = "SSH 算法:%@";
"SSH, older algorithms" = "SSH(旧版算法)";
"%@ belongs to %@; its VLANs follow the LAG. Netdeck doesn't change them." = "%@ 属于 %@;其 VLAN 跟随该 LAG。Netdeck 不会更改它们。";
"%@ is a routed port. Netdeck doesn't change VLANs on routed ports." = "%@ 是路由端口。Netdeck 不会更改路由端口上的 VLAN。";
"%@: '?' can't be typed in a description on this switch." = "%@:此交换机的描述中不能输入“?”。";
"%@: a trunk port must carry at least one VLAN. With none, AOS-CX carries them all." = "%@:trunk 端口至少要承载一个 VLAN。一个都没有时,AOS-CX 会承载全部 VLAN。";
"'%@': AOS-CX VLAN names are 1–32 characters: letters, digits, '_' and '-'." = "“%@”:AOS-CX 的 VLAN 名称为 1–32 个字符:字母、数字、“_”和“-”。";
"AOS-CX %@ may not restore the configuration if the session drops before you confirm (fixed in 10.06). Update the switch to make changes with Netdeck." = "如果在你确认前会话断开,AOS-CX %@ 可能不会恢复配置(已在 10.06 修复)。请更新交换机后再用 Netdeck 更改。";
"AOS-CX commands" = "AOS-CX 命令";
"Another change is already waiting for confirmation on this switch (an auto checkpoint is running). Netdeck doesn't apply changes until it ends." = "此交换机上已有另一项更改在等待确认(auto checkpoint 正在运行)。在它结束前,Netdeck 不会应用更改。";
"If you don't confirm, the switch restores the configuration it had before the change." = "如果你不确认,交换机会恢复更改前的配置。";
"Netdeck couldn't save the configuration before the change:" = "Netdeck 无法保存更改前的配置:";
"Netdeck needs administrator rights on this switch. Log in as an administrator or manager user." = "Netdeck 需要此交换机的管理员权限。请以 administrator 或 manager 用户登录。";
"The switch can't change a VLAN's number. Add a VLAN with the new number and move the ports to it." = "交换机无法更改 VLAN 的编号。请添加一个使用新编号的 VLAN,并将端口移到其中。";
"The switch has no candidate configuration to check in advance. It applies each command at once; if one is rejected, or if you don't confirm in time, it restores the configuration it had before the change." = "交换机没有可预先检查的候选配置。它会立即应用每条命令;如果某条命令被拒绝,或者你没有及时确认,它会恢复更改前的配置。";
"This switch can't undo changes on its own (no auto checkpoint). Netdeck doesn't apply changes without it." = "此交换机无法自行撤销更改(没有 auto checkpoint)。没有它,Netdeck 不会应用更改。";
"%@: a description can't contain '\"'." = "%@:描述中不能包含“\"”。";
"%@: the port must stay a member of at least one VLAN." = "%@:端口必须至少保留在一个 VLAN 中。";
"'%@': VLAN names on this switch are 1–32 characters and can't contain '\"'." = "“%@”:此交换机的 VLAN 名称为 1–32 个字符,不能包含“\"”。";
"AOS-S commands" = "AOS-S 命令";
"Another change is already waiting for confirmation on this switch (Netdeck's restore job is scheduled). Netdeck doesn't apply changes until it ends." = "此交换机上已有另一项更改在等待确认(Netdeck 的恢复任务已排定)。在它结束前,Netdeck 不会应用更改。";
"Netdeck couldn't set up the job that restores the configuration:" = "Netdeck 无法设置恢复配置的任务:";
"This switch's VLANs have no description. Leave it empty." = "此交换机的 VLAN 没有描述。请留空。";
"This switch's firmware (%@) can't restore a configuration without restarting; that needs 16.05 or later. Netdeck reads it but doesn't change it." = "此交换机的固件(%@)无法在不重启的情况下恢复配置;需要 16.05 或更高版本。Netdeck 只读取它,不会更改。";
"TP-Link commands" = "TP-Link 命令";
"If you don't confirm, the switch restarts with its saved configuration. It is offline for a few minutes." = "如果你不确认,交换机会以已保存的配置重新启动,并离线几分钟。";
"The switch has no candidate configuration to check in advance. It applies each command at once and saves nothing until you confirm. If a command is rejected, Netdeck puts the previous settings back; if you don't confirm in time, the switch restarts with its saved configuration." = "这台交换机没有可提前检查的候选配置。它会立即应用每条命令,在你确认之前不保存任何内容。如果某条命令被拒绝,Netdeck 会恢复之前的设置;如果你没有及时确认,交换机会以已保存的配置重新启动。";
"This switch has changes that aren't saved yet. Netdeck's safety net restarts the switch with its saved configuration, which would lose them too. Save or undo them on the switch first." = "这台交换机有尚未保存的更改。Netdeck 的安全网会以已保存的配置重启交换机,这些更改也会丢失。请先在交换机上保存或撤销它们。";
"An Omada controller manages this switch, and it only takes show commands. Netdeck reads it but doesn't change it; make changes in the controller." = "这台交换机由 Omada 控制器管理,只接受 show 命令。Netdeck 只读取它而不做更改;请在控制器中进行更改。";
"Netdeck couldn't schedule the restart that undoes the change:" = "Netdeck 无法安排用于撤销更改的重启:";
"Netdeck couldn't put every setting back by itself. The switch restarts with its saved configuration within a minute and is offline for a few minutes." = "Netdeck 无法自行恢复所有设置。交换机将在一分钟内以已保存的配置重新启动,并离线几分钟。";
"%@: port descriptions on this switch are at most 16 characters, without quotes, brackets or < > , \\ &." = "%@:这台交换机上的端口描述最多 16 个字符,不能包含引号、括号或 < > , \\ &。";
"%@ has a VLAN setup Netdeck can't show as access or trunk (%@). Change it on the switch." = "%@ 的 VLAN 设置无法在 Netdeck 中显示为 access 或 trunk(%@)。请在交换机上更改。";
"'%@': VLAN names on this switch are 1–16 characters and can't contain \" < > , \\ or &." = "'%@':这台交换机上的 VLAN 名称为 1–16 个字符,不能包含 \" < > , \\ 或 &。";
